 --> src/App.wf:3:33
  |
3 |     Button("Save") { on click { emit saved() } }
  |                                 ^^^^
  = docs: https://webfluent.monzeromer.dev/errors/E114"#, quickfix: "", lowerable: false, why: false, example: true, families: ERROR_INDEX, related: [], sections: [Anchor(id: "printed", label: t("error.printed")), Anchor(id: "fix", label: t("error.fix"))], source: "md-docs/errors/E114.md") {
