page ErrorA05(path: "/errors/A05", title: "A05 — A button with no text", description: "A `Button` with no text: no label, no `aria-label:`, and no `Text` in its block.") {
    ErrorShell("A05", title: "A button with no text", severity: "warning", family: "Accessibility", summary: "A `Button` with no text: no label, no `aria-label:`, and no `Text` in its block.", printed: #"warning[A05]: Button has no text content
 --> src/App.wf:3:5
  |
3 |     Button { Icon("check") }
  |     ^^^^^^
  = help: Add text: Button("Save").primary
  = docs: https://webfluent.monzeromer.dev/errors/A05"#, quickfix: "", lowerable: true, why: false, example: true, families: ERROR_INDEX, related: [], sections: [Anchor(id: "printed", label: t("error.printed")), Anchor(id: "fix", label: t("error.fix"))], source: "md-docs/errors/A05.md") {
