}"#, title: "wf") }
        note {
            Markdown("Give it text — `Button(\"Save\")`, or a `Text` in its block beside\nthe icon, `Button \{ Icon(\"check\")  Text(\"Save\") \}` — or an `aria-label:`\nwhen it shows only an icon. A `Text` anywhere in the block names it — in a\nbranch, in a component the block places, or reading state; a `Tooltip`'s\nwords, which show only on hover, do not.")
            Markdown("Each example is a whole program: it is all of `src/App.wf` in a project with no other `.wf` file ([trying an example](/errors#trying-an-example)).") { style { font-size: 14px; color: $muted } }
        }
    }
}

