    color-background: #FFFFFF
}
page P(path: "/", title: "T", description: "D") {
    Heading("Contrast").h1
}"#, title: "wf") }
        fixed { CodeBlock(#"theme Faint {
    color-text: #333333
    color-background: #FFFFFF
}
page P(path: "/", title: "T", description: "D") {
    Heading("Contrast").h1
}"#, title: "wf") }
        note {
            Markdown("Darken the text or lighten the background until the ratio clears 4.5:1 (3:1 for large text).")
            Markdown("Each example is a whole program: it is all of `src/App.wf` in a project with no other `.wf` file ([trying an example](/errors#trying-an-example)).") { style { font-size: 14px; color: $muted } }
        }
        Markdown("The theme must be the one the build uses: the only one declared, or the\none `theme.name` names in the config. A project `wf init` made names\n`Day`, so to try this example remove `theme` from its config.")
    }
}

page ErrorA14(path: "/errors/A14", title: "A14 — A role whose children are the wrong kind", description: "A `role:` that requires particular children holds a control that is not one.") {
