page ErrorA18(path: "/errors/A18", title: "A18 — A popover with no name", description: "A `Popover` drawn as a dialog (it has no other `role:`) with no `label:`: a screen reader announces it as a dialog and nothing more.") {
    ErrorShell("A18", title: "A popover with no name", severity: "warning", family: "Accessibility", summary: "A `Popover` drawn as a dialog (it has no other `role:`) with no `label:`: a screen reader announces it as a dialog and nothing more.", printed: #"warning[A18]: Popover has no accessible name
 --> src/App.wf:5:5
  |
